  "info": {
    "description": "Android 设备提供的操作。Rust 通过 `DeviceClient` 调用，Kotlin 实现同名接口。",
    "title": "Device",
    "version": "0.1.0"
  },
  "methods": [
    {
      "description": "列出可启动的应用。\n\n默认只返回带 LAUNCHER 入口的包。\n\n```json\n{\"include_system\": false}\n```\n\n```json\n{\"apps\": [{\"package_name\": \"com.tencent.mm\", \"label\": \"微信\", \"launchable\": true}]}\n```",
      "name": "app.list",
      "paramStructure": "by-name",
      "params": [
        {
          "description": "是否包含系统应用，默认 false。",
          "name": "include_system",
          "required": false,
          "schema": {
            "description": "是否包含系统应用，默认 false。",
            "type": [
              "boolean",
              "null"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "result": {
        "name": "result",
        "schema": {
          "$ref": "#/components/schemas/AppListResult"
        }
      },
      "summary": "列出可启动的应用。"
    },
    {
      "description": "启动应用。\n\n返回只表示请求已被接受，真正成功以 `ui.window_changed` 为准。\n\n```json\n{\"package_name\": \"com.tencent.mm\"}\n```\n\n```json\n{\"accepted\": true}\n```",
      "name": "app.launch",
      "paramStructure": "by-name",
      "params": [
        {
          "description": "",
          "name": "package_name",
          "required": true,
          "schema": {
            "type": "string"
          }
        },
        {
          "description": "指定 Activity，省略则用 LAUNCHER 入口。",
          "name": "activity",
          "required": false,
          "schema": {
            "description": "指定 Activity，省略则用 LAUNCHER 入口。",
            "type": [
              "string",
              "null"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "description": "启动前是否强制停止。",
          "name": "force_stop",
          "required": false,
          "schema": {
            "description": "启动前是否强制停止。",
            "type": [
              "boolean",
              "null"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "result": {
        "name": "result",
        "schema": {
          "$ref": "#/components/schemas/AppLaunchResult"
        }
      },
      "summary": "启动应用。"
    },
    {
      "description": "读取当前窗口的节点树。\n\n`seq` 对应该次快照观察到的最后一个事件序号。\n节点 id 只在本次快照内有效，跨快照需要按指纹重新匹配。\n\n```json\n{\"filter\": \"actionable\"}\n```\n\n```json\n{\"seq\": 42, \"package_name\": \"com.tencent.mm\", \"activity\": \".ui.LauncherUI\", \"truncated\": false, \"nodes\": []}\n```",
      "name": "ui.snapshot",
      "paramStructure": "by-name",
      "params": [
        {
          "description": "`actionable` 或 `all`，默认 `actionable`。",
          "name": "filter",
          "required": false,
          "schema": {
            "description": "`actionable` 或 `all`，默认 `actionable`。",
            "type": [
              "string",
              "null"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "description": "节点上限，默认 800。",
          "name": "max_nodes",
          "required": false,
          "schema": {
            "description": "节点上限，默认 800。",
            "format": "int32",
            "type": [
              "integer",
              "null"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "result": {
        "name": "result",
        "schema": {
          "$ref": "#/components/schemas/UiSnapshotResult"
        }
      },
      "summary": "读取当前窗口的节点树。"
    },
    {
      "description": "按节点执行语义动作。\n\n节点动作不被支持时返回 `2002`，由调用方决定是否改用祖先节点或手势。\n\n```json\n{\"node\": \"n7\", \"action\": \"click\"}\n```\n\n```json\n{\"changed\": true}\n```",
      "name": "ui.act",
      "paramStructure": "by-name",
      "params": [
        {
          "description": "",
          "name": "node",
          "required": true,
          "schema": {
            "type": "string"
          }
        },
        {
          "description": "`click`、`long_click`、`set_text`、`clear_text`、`focus`、`scroll_forward`、`scroll_backward`、`select`。",
          "name": "action",
          "required": true,
          "schema": {
            "description": "`click`、`long_click`、`set_text`、`clear_text`、`focus`、`scroll_forward`、`scroll_backward`、`select`。",
            "type": "string"
          }
        },
        {
          "description": "`set_text` 使用。",
          "name": "text",
          "required": false,
          "schema": {
            "description": "`set_text` 使用。",
            "type": [
              "string",
              "null"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "result": {
        "name": "result",
        "schema": {
          "$ref": "#/components/schemas/UiActResult"
        }
      },
      "summary": "按节点执行语义动作。"
    },
    {
      "description": "执行原始手势。\n\n同一手势最多 10 个 stroke，总时长不超过 60 秒。\n\n```json\n{\"strokes\": [{\"points\": [{\"x\": 540, \"y\": 1800}, {\"x\": 540, \"y\": 600}], \"duration_ms\": 300}]}\n```\n\n```json\n{\"performed\": true}\n```",
      "name": "ui.gesture",
      "paramStructure": "by-name",
      "params": [
        {
          "description": "",
          "name": "strokes",
          "required": true,
          "schema": {
            "items": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/GestureStroke"
            },
            "type": "array"
          }
        },
        {
          "description": "",
          "name": "timeout_ms",
          "required": false,
          "schema": {
            "format": "int32",
            "type": [
              "integer",
              "null"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "result": {
        "name": "result",
        "schema": {
          "$ref": "#/components/schemas/UiGestureResult"
        }
      },
      "summary": "执行原始手势。"
    },
    {
      "description": "等待界面进入稳定状态。\n\n`idle` 表示连续 300 毫秒没有新的界面事件。\n\n```json\n{\"until\": \"idle\", \"timeout_ms\": 5000}\n```\n\n```json\n{\"matched\": true}\n```",
      "name": "ui.wait",
      "paramStructure": "by-name",
      "params": [
        {
          "description": "`idle`、`window` 或 `text`。",
          "name": "until",
          "required": true,
          "schema": {
            "description": "`idle`、`window` 或 `text`。",
            "type": "string"
          }
        },
        {
          "description": "`window` 时为包名，`text` 时为子串。",
          "name": "value",
          "required": false,
          "schema": {
            "description": "`window` 时为包名，`text` 时为子串。",
            "type": [
              "string",
              "null"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "description": "",
          "name": "timeout_ms",
          "required": false,
          "schema": {
            "format": "int32",
            "type": [
              "integer",
              "null"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "result": {
        "name": "result",
        "schema": {
          "$ref": "#/components/schemas/UiWaitResult"
        }
      },
      "summary": "等待界面进入稳定状态。"
    },
    {
      "description": "抓取一帧画面。\n\nJSON-RPC 返回图片元数据；图片字节使用独立的二进制消息传输。\n\n```json\n{\"max_width\": 720}\n```\n\n```json\n{\"mime\": \"image/png\", \"width\": 540, \"height\": 1200, \"bytes\": 184320}\n```",
      "name": "ui.screenshot",
      "paramStructure": "by-name",
      "params": [
        {
          "description": "缩放上限，默认不缩放。",
          "name": "max_width",
          "required": false,
          "schema": {
            "description": "缩放上限，默认不缩放。",
            "format": "int32",
            "type": [
              "integer",
              "null"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "result": {
        "name": "result",
        "schema": {
          "$ref": "#/components/schemas/UiScreenshotInfo"
        }
      },
      "summary": "抓取一帧画面。"
    },
    {
